     1196   subject
     1197   position_
     1198   .
     1199   DEFINE BUFFER firm_conf-import FOR conf-import.
     1200   DEFINE BUFFER person_conf-import FOR conf-import.
     1201   DEFINE BUTTON B-cli-grp
     1202        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
